Addendum - Attribution & Brand Protection (English)

1. Attribution for Derivative Works:
Any modified versions, forks, or derivative works based on this project must prominently retain the original author's name "XingYuan" and a link to the original "XingYuanBot" repository in the README.md or equivalent documentation. You may add your own name, but you must not remove the original attribution.

2. Brand Protection:
The name "XingYuanBot" (and its Chinese equivalent "星缘机器人") is the exclusive identifier of the original author. 
Without prior written permission, you may not use "XingYuanBot" or "星缘机器人" as the primary name for your derivative works or secondary development releases. (Derivative names like "XingYuanBot-Plus" or "XingYuanBot-Extended" are acceptable as long as they do not cause confusion).

3. Commercial Use:
Commercial use is permitted (e.g., paid hosting, commercial group management), but you assume all compliance and security risks.
